# TOEIC Vocabulary Day56

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| sufficient | 충분한 | We have sufficient supplies. |
| shortage | 부족, 결핍 | The company is facing a staff shortage. |
| quantity | 양, 수량 | We ordered a large quantity of materials. |
| amount | 양, 액수 | A small amount of water is needed. |
| requirement | 요구 사항 | Please check the job requirements. |
| supply | 공급품, 공급하다 | The office needs more supplies. |
| accurate | 정확한 | The report contains accurate information. |
| additional | 추가적인 | We need additional documents. |
| available | 이용 가능한 | Several seats are available. |
| optional | 선택적인 | Attendance at the workshop is optional. |

### 암기 포인트

- sufficient time: 충분한 시간
- a shortage of staff: 인력 부족
- a large quantity of products: 많은 양의 제품
- a small amount of money: 적은 액수의 돈
- job requirements: 직무 요구 사항
- additional information: 추가 정보
